{
  "name": "hannibal",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 119.447,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Why did Hannibal, Carthage's greatest general, march for five months over the Alps, when Italy was two weeks' sail away?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 8.085,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "36784ff94260"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "The answer is on this route, and in the one thing Carthage had lost: the sea.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.186,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "36784ff94260"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Spain, 218 BC.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.252,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "32d6004713aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Hannibal leads his army north from New Carthage.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.877,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "32d6004713aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "At nine, he had sworn to his father never to be a friend of Rome.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.33,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "32d6004713aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "He crosses the Ebro and the Pyrenees, leaving troops behind to hold Spain.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.72,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "32d6004713aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "About forty-six thousand men cross the Rhône.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.422,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "32d6004713aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "Thirty-seven elephants follow, ferried over on rafts.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.313,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "32d6004713aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But a Roman army has already landed at the river's mouth.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.145,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "6d8c0eec015c"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "It came by sea.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.859,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "6d8c0eec015c"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Rome had won the last war, and taken Sicily and Sardinia.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.009,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "6d8c0eec015c"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "That year, Rome put two hundred and twenty ships to sea.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.502,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "6d8c0eec015c"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "The sea belonged to Rome.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.975,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "6d8c0eec015c"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So the only way into Italy was over the mountains, where Celtic tribes were ready to join him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.159,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "6d8c0eec015c"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "At a place called the Island, where two rivers meet, he turns toward the Alps.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.483,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "6d8c0eec015c"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "In a narrow gorge, mountain tribes ambush the column.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.556,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "1c1d5514c5b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.5,
      "text": "The climb to the pass takes nine days.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.578,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "1c1d5514c5b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "At the top, snow already covers the pass.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.858,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "143f62503415"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "His men are exhausted, and losing heart.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.151,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "143f62503415"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So Hannibal shows them the plains of Italy, far below.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.151,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "143f62503415"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 2,
      "text": "The boy who swore that oath was finally looking at Italy.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.514,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "143f62503415"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Going down is worse.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.701,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7933489f1ac0"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Fresh snow lies on old ice, and men and animals slide off the path.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.911,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7933489f1ac0"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A landslide has swept the trail away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.154,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7933489f1ac0"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "It takes three days to rebuild it for the starving elephants.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.746,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7933489f1ac0"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "In the plain of the Po, he counts what is left.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.898,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7933489f1ac0"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "About twenty-six thousand men.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.848,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7933489f1ac0"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "Hannibal later had that number engraved in bronze.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.268,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7933489f1ac0"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "In Virgil's Aeneid, Queen Dido prays for an avenger to rise from her bones.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.34,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7fac19c61775"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Many readers take that avenger to be Hannibal.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.28,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7fac19c61775"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Two weeks of sailing became five months, sixteen hundred kilometres, and half an army.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.022,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7fac19c61775"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Rome held the sea, so Hannibal took the mountains.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.54,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7fac19c61775"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "Dido's avenger had come, not by sea, but over the Alps.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/hannibal/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.614,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "7fac19c61775"
    }
  ]
}
